    "title": "Lead Instructional Designer at Cuemath",
    "description": "An exciting career opportunity awaits you at Cuemath. We are on the lookout for a dedicated Instructional Designer to strengthen our Ludhiana-based team.\n\nAbout Cuemath:\nCuemath is a leading organization in the Remote sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Coordinate with academic counselors for student career guidance\n• Design formative and summative assessments aligned to learning objectives\n• Develop and deliver engaging lesson plans for students\n• Create curriculum-aligned learning materials and assessments\n• Monitor student progress and provide timely feedback\n• Contribute to school newsletter, blogs, and other publications\n• Collaborate with faculty on curriculum development initiatives\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• B.Com / M.Com / MBA Finance\n• 3-6 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in LMS Platforms\n• Proficiency in Curriculum Development\n• Proficiency in E-learning\n• Proficiency in Data Analysis\n• Proficiency in Special Education\n• Proficiency in Research Skills\n• Proficiency in Communication Skills\n• Proficiency in Bloom's Taxonomy\n\nWork Mode: Remote - Work from anywhere in India\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Recognition and rewards programs\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Provident Fund and Gratuity as per company policy\n• Work-from-home flexibility\n• International travel opportunities for senior roles\n• Meal coupons and food allowance\n• Salary Range: 7 LPA - 15 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Ludhiana, Punjab, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Cuemath!",
